{"hash": "9367bb2433fb4776", "text": "In 2021, the back room held notes for tools: settings, history, a list of things to ignore. The worst common mistake was committing a dot E N V. Since 2025, some of those notes are orders. An agent follows them, and some are commands it runs. So a stranger's note pinned to your wall gets obeyed too. In March 2025, researchers hid invisible instructions in a rules file. Others showed that a repository's own Claude settings could run commands or leak a key when someone opened it. Those holes were fixed, but the lesson stuck: these files are code. Malware learned the layout too. In August 2025, a poisoned package ran its victims' own AI command-line tools to search their disks for keys. GitGuardian, a company that scans for leaked keys, counted AI-service keys leaking about eighty percent more in 2025 than the year before.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "2", "0", "2", "1", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", " ", "h", "e", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", "e", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "t", "o", "o", "l", "s", ":", " ", "s", "e", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", "s", ",", " ", "h", "i", "s", "t", "o", "r", "y", ",", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "s", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "i", "g", "n", "o", "r", "e", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "r", "s", "t", " ", "c", "o", "m", "m", "o", "n", " ", "m", "i", "s", "t", "a", "k", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "o", "m", "m", "i", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", " ", "d", "o", "t", " ", "E", " ", "N", " ", "V", ".", " ", "S", "i", "n", "c", "e", " ", "2", "0", "2", "5", ",", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "n", "o", "t", "e", "s", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "o", "r", "d", "e", "r", "s", ".", " ", "A", "n", " ", "a", "g", "e", "n", "t", " ", "f", "o", "l", "l", "o", "w", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e",